1.	Create a parent page and a child page
2.	Set page permissions on the parent → grant to a web role
3.	Disable inherited permissions on the child page
4.	Log in as that web role → parent page visible ✅, child page NOT visible ❌
5.	Enable inherited permissions → child page now visible ✅
✅ Exercise 5: See Identity Providers
1.	In Power Pages → Set up → Identity Providers
2.	See available options: Local sign-in, Azure AD, Microsoft Account, Google, Facebook
3.	This is what Q120 tests — which provider + open registration setting
